    "proseDraft": "The record lists no confirmed resolutions and no unresolved items, only stated remarks. Those statements cover questionnaire ownership, next-Friday timing, format, attachments, and checks to be made.\n\nStated in the meeting\n- It was stated that Kwame owns the questionnaire with return to them next Friday.\n- It was stated that their procurement lead said it is needed back next Friday.\n- It was stated that next Friday is fine and time can be blocked out for it.\n- It was stated that the legal and insurance sections will be done and passed to Kwame to merge in.\n- It was stated that a spreadsheet was mentioned and they said the portal is being replaced.\n- It was stated as a question whether they want it in their portal or as a spreadsheet.\n- It was stated to attach the summary letter and not the full report because that needs an NDA.\n- It was stated as a question whether to attach the pen test summary or just reference it.\n- It was stated that it will be double-checked whether it covers security documents.\n- It was stated that both will then be answered and flagged.\n- It was stated that their procurement lead will be told it is in progress.\n- It was stated to put them in the shared folder and not by email.\n- It was stated as a question whether they want the certificate itself or just the coverage amounts.\n- It was stated that it will be asked when writing to procurement.\n- It was stated that it needs to be checked whether Brightwater is set up as EU or US."
